# wrong in the ways a person guessing is wrong - several of these are Berlin
# before they are German (icke, dit, wat, jut, ooch, keen), and he does not
# know yet that the rest of the country does not say them.
#
# Once the story has let him find a word out, the journal shows what he found
# instead of this; the guess stays underneath as "first thought".

